Aap ek skript likh sakte hain jo kisi website ke liye aksess kontrol (access control) ka parikshan kare. Yeh skript uska anusaar karamat rahega jo aapka website ya web application aapki pryatnata (security) ko saath saath user access ko bhi niyantri karne mein madad kare. Isme, aap niyantrit kar sakte hain k kon saare users kaise access kar sakte hain, kya hak (permissions) hain unke paas, aur kya kisi specific section ya page ka access limit kiya ja sakta hai.

Yahan ek basik JavaScript skript ka ek example diya gaya hai jo HTML, CSS aur Node.js ke saath kaam karne ka prayaas karta hai:

**1. HTML (index.html):**

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Access Control Example</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
</head>
<body>
    <div id="restricted-content">
        <h1>Restricted Area</h1>
        <p>Yeh content sirf sahi pravaad (authenticated) users ke liye available hai.</p>
    </div>
    <button id="login-button">Login</button>

    <script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
```

**2. CSS (styles.css):**

```css
body {
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
}

#restricted-content {
    display: none; /* Initially hide restricted content */
}
```

